+```text
+setVSAt(CUR, 2*I+1, valSeqAt(SORTED,I))
+setVSAt(CUR, 2*I,   valSeqAt(SORTED,I))
+```
+
+Thus the connection proof is sensitive to the displaced program body itself,
+not merely to an external `solution.py` file.
